      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure how such a thing would even be possible. It might be possible to create an `SkUserTypeface` from the CoreText SkTypeface created with `PingFangUI.TTC`, serialize that, then deserialize. However, that would already work since it\u0027s already on the decoders list. `SkCustomTypefaceBuilder` should be returning nullptr here, since the data is obviously not the data serialized by an `SkUserTypeface`.",
